<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin">I wanted to reach out to you today, as a valued member of the Black&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin">community, in
hosting another American Red Cross blood drive. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">African American blood donors play a critical role in
helping patients battling sickle cell disease to receive the most compatible
blood match. Today, there aren’t enough African American donors to meet this
urgent need.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Answer the call to help save those suffering from
diseases, such as sickle cell, by hosting a Red Cross blood drive and
collecting the most compatible blood for to help support over 100,000 sickle
cell patients and families.</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Our Blood Saves Lives!</b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please call me at </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">&lt;XXX_XXX_XXXX&gt;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> or email me at </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">&lt;email address&gt;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> to schedule your
lifesaving blood drive today.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
